[{"text":"FCLoopSwitchEtaSign[exp, s] switches the sign of i \\eta in all integrals to s, where s can be +1 or -1.","anchor":"fcloopswitchetasign"},{"text":"Notice to change the sign of \\(i \\eta\\) the function pulls out a factor \\(-1\\) from the propagator.","anchor":"fcloopswitchetasign"},{"text":"Overview, FCTopology, FCLoopGetEtaSigns.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"FADs are automatically converted to SFADs, since otherwise their \\(i \\eta\\) prescription cannot be modified","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FAD[{p, m}] FCLoopSwitchEtaSign[%, 1]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{p^2-m^2}\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p^2-m^2+i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FAD[{p, m}] FCLoopSwitchEtaSign[%, -1]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{p^2-m^2}\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{1}{(-p^2+m^2-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"SFAD[{p, m^2}] FCLoopSwitchEtaSign[%, -1]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p^2-m^2+i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{1}{(-p^2+m^2-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"CFAD[{p, m^2}] FCLoopSwitchEtaSign[%, 1]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p^2+m^2-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{1}{(-p^2-m^2+i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"}]